      "name": "Neeraj Lilani",
      "created_at": "2025-08-25T10:58:10.441Z",
      "cooked": "<p>PS: perhaps the previous selling price could be developed such that the previous selling price I see is for that specific selected customer, same goes with buying - or perhaps these could be select-able in settings such that the user can choose whatever they prefer.</p>",
