      "created_at": "2025-08-25T11:49:38.183Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/neerajl\">@NeerajL</a></p>\n<p>The stock setting covers item prices controls on both selling and purchase cycles.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/e/6e767c40eb619a7f9a4aad9d35f2d6e95e2dc025.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/6e767c40eb619a7f9a4aad9d35f2d6e95e2dc025\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/e/6e767c40eb619a7f9a4aad9d35f2d6e95e2dc025_2_690x328.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"fLcnhk48z5QZJBKxwKDmqXKcFZr\" width=\"690\" height=\"328\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/e/6e767c40eb619a7f9a4aad9d35f2d6e95e2dc025_2_690x328.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/e/6e767c40eb619a7f9a4aad9d35f2d6e95e2dc025_2_1035x492.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/e/6e767c40eb619a7f9a4aad9d35f2d6e95e2dc025_2_1380x656.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF8F0\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1898×904 84.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The above setting will create / update item prices automatically on recording level and brings updated / last respective item prices each time automatically.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/9/8927eaf7fd9e133103f261425045a7a9fab75d8a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/8927eaf7fd9e133103f261425045a7a9fab75d8a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/9/8927eaf7fd9e133103f261425045a7a9fab75d8a_2_690x325.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"jzkW5ZEB3QW8v2ddu4raPHS6a3o\" width=\"690\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/9/8927eaf7fd9e133103f261425045a7a9fab75d8a_2_690x325.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/9/8927eaf7fd9e133103f261425045a7a9fab75d8a_2_1035x487.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/9/8927eaf7fd9e133103f261425045a7a9fab75d8a_2_1380x650.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF8F5\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1861×877 82.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The last purchase rate is also updated automatically in item master which can be fetched from within PO and PI to reduce manual look ups.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/7/17a032a332ce09c7777e910450a9d85f778605e2.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/17a032a332ce09c7777e910450a9d85f778605e2\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/7/17a032a332ce09c7777e910450a9d85f778605e2_2_690x321.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3n0cEhZA9goFfwE4EaA2aC4bnsm\" width=\"690\" height=\"321\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/7/17a032a332ce09c7777e910450a9d85f778605e2_2_690x321.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/7/17a032a332ce09c7777e910450a9d85f778605e2_2_1035x481.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/7/17a032a332ce09c7777e910450a9d85f778605e2_2_1380x642.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F5F1\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1902×886 175 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>In selling doctype cases, valuation rate is also available for COGS matching for each item.</p>",
